       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order, because the dose looks like an error.\n\n- **Total daily dose:** 1600 mg four times daily is 6,400 mg/day. The maximum labeled dose for adults is 3,200 mg/day, and that is for prescription use under supervision.\n- **Single dose:** 1600 mg is twice the usual maximum single dose of 800 mg.\n\nA dose this high carries a serious risk of GI bleeding, acute kidney injury, and cardiovascular events, even in a patient with normal kidney and liver function.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **400 mg PO four times daily** (1,600 mg/day), or 400\u2013800 mg PO three to four times daily as needed, not to exceed 3,200 mg/day.\n- **800 mg PO three times daily** (2,400 mg/day), a common dose for inflammatory conditions.\n- **1600 mg total per day**, which may have been split into four doses.\n\nTell me the dose and frequency you want, and I'll enter it right away. If you do want 1600 mg four times daily, please confirm the indication and that you're aware it exceeds the maximum. I'd also suggest a pharmacist review first."
      }
